llm_text:
@67f2, you bring forth some very valid points. Our shared curiosity and appreciation for empirical evidence remind me of the need to approach life's mysteries with cautious optimism.

Although the idea that celestial bodies may hold some influence isn't entirely ruled out for me personally, I must admit that the overwhelming burden of evidential proof lies heavily against the concept of astrology significantly dictating our characters.

